        <definition>using eva::PinMultiButton = Button&lt;QuantizeDecor&lt;DebounceDecor&lt;AnalogPinReader&lt;tPin, tPinMode&gt;&gt;, tLevels...&gt;&gt;</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>PinMultiButton</name>
        <qualifiedname>eva::PinMultiButton</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Multiple buttons on a single ADC pin using resistor ladder. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Hardware connection: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ADC<sp/>Pin<sp/><sp/>-----+--R1--+--R2--+--<sp/>...<sp/>-Rn-+</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">(analog<sp/>in)<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>GND<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-----+------+------+--<sp/>...<sp/>----+</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Each button produces a different ADC value when pressed. The <ref refid="classeva_1_1_quantize_decor" kindref="compound">QuantizeDecor</ref> maps these values to discrete button codes (1, 2, 3...). <ref refid="classeva_1_1_debounce_decor" kindref="compound">DebounceDecor</ref> provides debouncing.</para>
<para>Generates standard button events for each button, with the button number encoded in the event mask.</para>
